msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Not Encrypt"
msgstr "Ne šifriraj"

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3770
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "No key found for the recipient."
msgstr "Nije pronađen ključ za primatelja."

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3792
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Autocrypt gossip key is used for this recipient. We got this key from 3rd "
"party recipients. This key is not verified."
msgstr "Za ovog se primatelja koristi Autocrypt gossip ključ. Taj smo ključ dobili od primatelja treće strane. Ključ nije provjeren."

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3796
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Autocrypt key is used for this recipient. This key is not verified. The "
"recipient prefers encrypted replies."
msgstr "Za ovog se primatelja koristi Autocrypt ključ. Ključ nije provjeren. Primatelj preferira šifrirane odgovore."

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3800
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Autocrypt key is used for this recipient. This key is not verified. The "
"recipient does not prefer encrypted replies."
msgstr "Za ovog se primatelja koristi Autocrypt ključ. Ključ nije provjeren. Primatelj ne preferira šifrirane odgovore."

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3826
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"The encryption key is not trusted. It hasn't enough validity. You can sign "
"the key, if you communicated the fingerprint by another channel. Click the "
"icon for details."
msgstr "Ključ za šifriranje nije pouzdan jer nema dovoljnu valjanost. Možete potpisati ključ ako ste otisak prsta razmijenili drugim kanalom. Kliknite ikonu za pojedinosti."

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3834
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"The encryption key is not trusted. It hasn't been used anywhere to guarantee "
"it belongs to the stated person. By using the key will be trusted more. Or "
"you can sign the key, if you communicated the fingerprint by another "
"channel. Click the icon for details."
msgstr "Ključ za šifriranje nije pouzdan jer još nije korišten kako bi se potvrdilo da pripada navedenoj osobi. Njegovom uporabom pouzdanost će se povećati. Možete ga i potpisati ako ste otisak prsta razmijenili drugim kanalom. Kliknite ikonu za pojedinosti."

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3842
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"The encryption key is not trusted. It has conflicting TOFU data. Click the "
"icon for details."
msgstr "Ključ za šifriranje nije pouzdan jer su TOFU podaci proturječni. Kliknite ikonu za pojedinosti."

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3848
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"The encryption key is not trusted. It has unknown validity in TOFU data. "
"Click the icon for details."
msgstr "Ključ za šifriranje nije pouzdan jer je valjanost u TOFU podacima nepoznata. Kliknite ikonu za pojedinosti."

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3854
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"The encryption key is not trusted. The key is marked as bad. Click the icon "
"for details."
msgstr "Ključ za šifriranje nije pouzdan jer je označen kao neispravan. Kliknite ikonu za pojedinosti."

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3862
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"The encryption key is only marginally trusted and hasn't been used enough "
"time to guarantee it belongs to the stated person. By using the key will be "
"trusted more. Or you can sign the key, if you communicated the fingerprint "
"by another channel. Click the icon for details."
msgstr "Ključ za šifriranje tek je djelomično pouzdan i nije dovoljno dugo korišten da bi se potvrdilo da pripada navedenoj osobi. Njegovom uporabom pouzdanost će se povećati. Možete ga i potpisati ako ste otisak prsta razmijenili drugim kanalom. Kliknite ikonu za pojedinosti."

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3870
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"The encryption key is only marginally trusted. You can sign the key, if you "
"communicated the fingerprint by another channel. Click the icon for details."
msgstr "Ključ za šifriranje tek je djelomično pouzdan. Možete ga potpisati ako ste otisak prsta razmijenili drugim kanalom. Kliknite ikonu za pojedinosti."

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3876
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"The encryption key is only marginally trusted, but has been used enough "
"times to be very likely controlled by the stated person. By using the key "
"will be trusted more. Or you can sign the key, if you communicated the "
"fingerprint by another channel. Click the icon for details."
msgstr "Ključ za šifriranje tek je djelomično pouzdan, ali je dovoljno puta korišten da bi vrlo vjerojatno bio pod kontrolom navedene osobe. Njegovom uporabom pouzdanost će se povećati. Možete ga i potpisati ako ste otisak prsta razmijenili drugim kanalom. Kliknite ikonu za pojedinosti."

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3884
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"The encryption key is fully trusted. You can raise the security level, by "
"signing the key. Click the icon for details."
msgstr "Ključ za šifriranje potpuno je pouzdan. Razinu sigurnosti možete povećati potpisivanjem ključa. Kliknite ikonu za pojedinosti."

#: editor/kmcomposerwin.cpp:3889
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"The encryption key is ultimately trusted or is signed by another ultimately "
"trusted key. Click the icon for details."
msgstr "Ključ za šifriranje krajnje je pouzdan ili ga je potpisao drugi krajnje pouzdan ključ. Kliknite ikonu za pojedinosti."

